                      <li>I undertake to promote harmony and well being of the country and shall not perform any public or private ceremonies in the Hostel which might cause friction and harmony.</li>
                      <li>I will pay the fine if any, incurred on me due to my behaviour in the hostel and incase of grievous reason I shall leave the Hostel of my own account.</li>
                      <li>I will not engage in any kind of Ragging activity.</li>
                    </ol>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-check mt-3">
